⚡️🇺🇸 Out of the blue and for no reason stated at all, the Commander of the USS Nuclear Submarine USS West Virginia has been relieved from command effective immediately due to what was simply stated to be "a loss of confidence."

It is unknown what were the little shreds of morality the Commander must have had to get removed from his position by the US navy.

